   "lines": [
    "Took communion at",
    "the Methodist Church;",
    "the services were simple",
    "and impressive.",
    "Much though I have",
    "enjoyed the trip, it has",
    "not made up to me",
    "for being away from",
    "my darling; nothing",
    "ever could. But it has",
    "done my health a",
    "world of good."
   ],
